{title: Suno Na Sangemarmar}
{artist: Arijit Singh Jeet Ganguly}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Suno na sangemarmar,        Kee ye minaare,
Kuch bhi nahi hay,        Aage tumhare, [A]
Aaj se dil pe mere,        Raaj [G]tumhaara, [Bm]taj tumhaara
[Bm]Suno na sangemarmar,        Kee ye minaare,
Kuch bhi nahi hay,        Aage tumhare, [A]
Aaj se dil pe mere,        Raaj [G]tumhaara, [Bm]taj tumhaara
[Bm]Suno na sangemarmar,        Kee ye minaare!
[Bm]Bin tere mad-damm mad-damm,        Bhi chal rahi thi dhadkan,
Jabse mile tum [A]hame,        Aanchal se tere [F]bandhe,
Dil udd raha [Bm]hay,        [Bm]Suno naa aasmaano,
Ke yeh sitaare..        Kuch bhi nahi hay,
Aage tumhare? [A],        [Bm]Yeh dekho sapne mere
Neendon se hoke tere,        Raaton se kehte hain [A]lo
Hum toh savere hai [F]wo,        Sach gaye [Bm]jo
[Bm]Suno na do jahaano ke yeh nazaare,        Kuch bhi nahi hai aage tumhaare [A]
Aaj se dil pe mere,        Raaj [G]tumhaara, [Bm]taj tumhaara
[Bm]Suno na sangemarmar,        Kee ye minaare!
